    { "dot": "violet", "title": "What would change", "items": [
      "After a handoff, the container opens the same session with a new fence and runs Pi there.",
      "Pi's own tools (read, write, edit, bash) run next to /workspace, with no round trip per tool.",
      "When the turn ends the session is handed back to a Lambda owner for the next message."
